@startuml seq-abr-playback
title Поток данных: адаптивное воспроизведение (VOD + ABR)

left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor Viewer as viewer
rectangle "Client Player\n(ABR)" as player
rectangle "CDN Edge" as cdn
rectangle "Video Serving" as serving
rectangle "DRM License Server" as drm
rectangle "Analytics" as analytics

viewer   --> player  : Play
player   --> cdn     : GET manifest
cdn      --> serving : origin pull (cache miss)
serving  --> cdn     : manifest (variants + key_id)
cdn      --> player  : manifest

player   --> drm     : key_id + device token
drm      --> player  : AES key\n(L1 → 4K, L3/Chrome → 720p)

player   --> cdn     : GET chunk (ABR-выбор качества)
cdn      --> player  : chunk (.ts / .m4s)\ncache hit >95% для VOD

player   --> analytics : buffer_health, position_sec [async]

note bottom of cdn
  Cache miss → origin pull (latency spike)
  CDN failure → retry другой PoP + downgrade bitrate
end note

@enduml
